<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan feed group to tender for 54,000T U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan feed group to tender for 54,000T U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry group said on Monday it would tender on Tuesday for one shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. corn.  </p>
<p>Shipment would be slated for March 20 to April 4 from the U.S. Gulf or April 5-19 from the Pacific Northwest, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>The group comprises Taiwan's Formosa Oilseed, Fomau Cereal, Morn Sun Feed Mill and Shin Tai Industry.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
